<title>USA: Katy Industries closed unit Beehive sale.</title>
<headline>Katy Industries closed unit Beehive sale.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Katy Industries Inc said Thursday it closed the sale of its Beehive Inc business to Weiler and Co Inc of Whitewater, Wisc., on July 14.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Katy's chief executive John Prann said in a statement he did not expect the sale to result in a significant sale or loss.</p>
<p>He added the divesture continues the company's concentration into its two areas of additional investment: electrical/electronic and sanitary maintenance businesses.</p>
</text>
